[{"id": 57149023, "text": "Two pieces of paper with writing on. In a child's writing it says, \"I like choclot cake and Grandma likes aple crumble.\" In an adult's writing it says, \"I like apple crumble and Skye likes chocolate cake!\"", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "favourite_foods_image", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "favourite_foods_image-01FX0PNFTSS9CAMTMJTWXBF8R7.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 55912689, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 55912732, "text": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Talk about your favourite foods. </li>\n<li>Both players say a sentence, e.g. 'I like chocolate cake,' or 'I like apple crumble.'</li>\n<li>Both players write down a sentence including both players' likes, using 'and' to connect them, e.g. 'I like chocolate cake and Grandma likes apple crumble.'</li>\n<li>Look at your sentences - compare similarities and differences between them. Does it matter what order you put the two foods in?</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableDa